minimal_patch:
在 syncDailyBoard 中，将终态复核分支与普通同步分支的入口改为先捕获终态证据，再决定重置：

1. 在函数开头新增：
   const finalBound = FINAL_STATUSES.includes(seat.status) && seat.review_verified === true && seat.review_receipt;
   const hadFinalEvidence = finalBound && seat.submission_verified === true && seat.accepted === true;

2. 在进入普通同步分支前，先尝试终态轻型重校验：
   if (hadFinalEvidence) {
     const {outcome, reason} = await recheckBoundFinalReview({root,record,agent,seat,snapshot,readRemote,now});
     if (outcome === 'verified') { seat.revalidation='verified'; seat.revalidation_reason=reason; seat.sync_reason='final_review_revalidated_stable'; saveLedger(root, record); continue; }
     if (outcome === 'unavailable') { seat.revalidation='unavailable'; seat.revalidation_reason=reason; seat.sync_reason='final_review_preserved_readonly_deferred'; saveLedger(root, record); continue; }
     // outcome === 'conflict': 降级并保留旧回执
     seat.review_conflict = true; seat.review_verified = false; seat.accepted = false; seat.status = 'review_unknown'; seat.sync_reason = `final_review_evidence_conflict:${reason}`; saveLedger(root, record); continue;
   }

3. 修改普通同步分支的重置逻辑：只有当 !hadFinalEvidence 时才执行 seat.submission_verified=false、seat.review_verified=false、seat.accepted=false，避免终态席位在非冲突路径被无条件清空。

4. 补充回归断言：在 scripts/tests/ans-cycle.test.mjs 中增加用例，构造 review_verified=true 的终态席位与 readRemote 抛错场景，断言 syncDailyBoard 后 seat.status 保持 completed_draft_review/rejected_draft_review、seat.review_verified 保持 true、seat.submission_verified 保持 true、seat.accepted 保持不变，并且不触发 submit_task 命令。
